# Trial-Size Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 28): the battlefield's scroll arm with the Scroll of Instant Warp already
# held. A SMN of level 20 with this quest accepted, the Mini Tuning Fork of Lightning and a Scroll of Instant Warp: the
# fork's trade to LP_Entrance, option 33 (index 2, arena 1), LIGHTNING_GREMLIN+6 killed; 32001's finish: Ramuh learned
# (RAMUH_UNLOCKED 0, 0, 5), the scroll held: none given, Windurst fame +20, completed.
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest OtherAreas.TrialSizeTrialByLightning accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfLightning
item ScrollOfInstantWarp
login
trade LP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfLightning x1 # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                    # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill LIGHTNING_GREMLIN+6                  # won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Ramuh learned; the scroll held: none given; Windurst fame +20; completed
